\v 11 \wj For ye have the poor always with you; but me ye have not always.\wj* 
\v 12 \wj For in that she hath poured this ointment on my body, she did it for my burial.\wj* 
\v 13 \wj Verily I say unto you, Wheresoever this gospel shall be preached in the whole world, there shall also this, that this woman hath done, be told for a memorial of her.\wj* 
\p
