\v 29 \wj But I say unto you, I will not drink henceforth of this fruit of the vine, until that day when I drink it new with you in my Father’s kingdom.\wj* 
\v 30 [And]{strong=“G2532” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Conj\sc* 1”} [when they had sung an hymn]{strong=“G5214” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Aap\sc*-\sc Npm\sc* 2”}, [they went out]{strong=“G1831” x-morph=“robinson: V-2\sc Aai\sc*-3P 3”} [into]{strong=“G1519” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Prep\sc* 4”} [the mount]{strong=“G3588 G3735” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Asn\sc* robinson: N-\sc Asn\sc* 5 6”} [of Olives]{strong=“G3588 G1636” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Gpf\sc* robinson: N-\sc Gpf\sc* 7 8”}. 
\v 31 [Then]{strong=“G5119” x-morph=“robinson: \sc Adv\sc* 1”} [saith]{strong=“G3004” x-morph=“robinson: V-\sc Pai\sc*-3S 2”} [Jesus]{strong=“G3588 G2424” x-morph=“robinson: T-\sc Nsm\sc* robinson: N-\sc Nsm\sc* 4 5”} [unto them]{strong=“G846” x-morph=“robinson: P-\sc Dpm\sc* 3”}, \wj All ye shall be offended because of me this night: for it is written, I will smite the shepherd, and the sheep of the flock shall be scattered abroad.\wj* 
\v 32 \wj But after I am risen again, I will go before you into Galilee.\wj* 
